# NuPhy Air96 V2 raw HID (VIA). The name sorts before 73-seat-late.rules so
# logind/seatd can turn TAG uaccess into an ACL for the active seat.
# Do not set MODE or GROUP here.
# Vendor 19f5. Product 3266 is keyboard.json / VIA JSON. Product 3265 is the
# id reported by later 2.1.x firmware. This rule does not match every NuPhy
# board: Air75 V3 uses a different product id and a different protocol.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="19f5", ATTRS{idProduct}=="3265", TAG+="uaccess"
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="19f5", ATTRS{idProduct}=="3266", TAG+="uaccess"
